sub:assertion {
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2024-anthrobots-27> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim>;
    dc:description "Because Anthrobots are made from adult human tissue, they could in future be personalized for each patient and deployed in that patient's body without triggering an immune response.";
    dc:type "prediction";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Patient-derived Anthrobots could be deployed in vivo without an immune response";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/context> "Gumuskaya G, Srivastava P, Cooper BG, Lesser H, Semegran B, Garnier S, Levin M, “Motile Living Biobots Self-Construct from Adult Human Somatic Progenitor Seed Cells”, Advanced science (Weinheim, Baden-Wurttemberg, Germany) (2024), doi:10.1002/advs.202303575; section “Discussion”. Scope: Autologous Anthrobots in human patients"
}
